Command Code: surface model reasoning effort like the other providers.

Upstream PR #10861 lists models with `capabilities: null`, so the composer
hides the Reasoning control that Codex, Claude, and Grok show. Command Code
already accepts `--effort` (`low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh`, `max`). The
adapter now advertises that select on every model and passes the chosen
level through to the CLI.

